cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite both the software (this archived release) and the associated publication listed under 'references'."
title: "Chromatid Arm Separation: an ImageJ/Fiji macro for quantifying sister-chromatid arm separation on metaphase spreads"
abstract: >-
  An ImageJ/Fiji macro that measures the separation between sister-chromatid
  arms on metaphase chromosome spreads. For a user-drawn line scan across a
  chromosome arm, it fits two fixed-width Gaussians to the intensity profile
  and reports the distance between their centres, together with fit-quality
  metrics, as per-arm and per-image CSV tables.
type: software
authors:
